  <h1>Laws of Worms (Insects)</h1>
  <div class="hebrew-title">הלכות תולעים</div>
  <div class="subtitle">Halachos 1 – 4 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Based on Likutay Moharan</div>
  <span class="ornament">❧</span>
